 "description": "Live availability of one wig or hairpiece style at MyHairMail, per colour, from the manufacturer's factory feed (not a nightly sync). Distinguishes backordered and discontinued colours, which the Shopify catalog reports as 'available' or omits. availability is one of in_stock | backordered (orderable now, ships when restocked; restock_eta_week given when known) | out_of_stock | discontinued (will not restock). Returns price_usd, compare_at_price_usd and a product_url to buy on myhairmail.com. With color: one product; without color: up to 12 colours (has_more=true means query a specific colour). Not found: did_you_mean styles, or supported_brands if the brand is not carried. When a colour is not buyable now, the response includes next_step naming the tool that finds an equivalent. Never returns quantities. Terms: https://mcp.myhairmailtools.com/terms",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "properties": {
   "brand": {
    "description": "Brand name, e.g. 'Jon Renau', 'Raquel Welch', 'Belle Tress'",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "color": {
    "description": "Color code or name, e.g. '12FS8' or 'Shaded Praline'. Optional; if omitted, returns per-color availability for up to 12 colors.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "style": {
    "description": "Style name, e.g. 'Luna', 'Vesper'",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "brand",
   "style"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "check_stock",
